      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Treaty of Purandar (1665): Signed between Shivaji Maharaj and Raja Jai Singh (representing Aurangzeb).",
        "Ashta Pradhan Roles: Questions frequently ask about 'Amatya' (Finance Minister) and 'Sumant/Dabir' (Foreign Minister).",
        "Chauth vs Sardeshmukhi: Remember Chauth was a 25% protection tax on non-Maratha lands, while Sardeshmukhi was an additional 10% tax claimed on hereditary rights.",
        "Third Battle of Panipat (1761): Fought between the Marathas led by Sadashivrao Bhau and Ahmed Shah Abdali."
